@startuml task-lifecycle-sequence
title Blaine — durable Task lifecycle
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor User
participant "Personal Agent" as Agent <<decision>>
participant "Blaine Core\nTask operations" as Core
participant "Durable Runtime\nRestate — current implementation" as Runtime <<runtime>>
participant Worker

User -> Agent : request independent work
Agent -> Core : create(TaskSpec — durable intent)
Core -> Runtime : accept durable Task intent
Runtime -> Runtime : assign identity; record state and workflow position
Runtime --> Core : Task ID + authoritative state
Core --> Agent : creation receipt
Agent --> User : Task ID and recorded state

Runtime -> Worker : execute current phase
Worker --> Runtime : outcome / progress

alt genuine user input is required
  Runtime -> Runtime : record WAITING_FOR_USER
  note over Agent,Worker
    The originating session and Worker may disappear.
    The durable Task identity and state remain.
  end note
  User -> Agent : later interaction
  Agent -> Core : signal(Task ID, continue / decision)
  Core -> Runtime : validated signal
  Runtime -> Runtime : record signal and resume when permitted
  Runtime -> Worker : execute / resume phase
  Worker --> Runtime : outcome / progress
else no durable wait
  Runtime -> Runtime : continue at recorded position
end

Runtime -> Runtime : record outcome or completion transition
Runtime --> Core : authoritative state and result references
Core --> Agent : current outcome
Agent --> User : evidenced result or honest waiting state

note over Agent,Runtime
  Task > conversation/session. Worker replacement does not replace the Task.
end note
@enduml
